+6. If the problem has several valid answers (e.g. "print any valid pair/triple/permutation"), write a validator (checker.py) invoked as `python3 checker.py input_file output_file` that checks every constraint of the output (indices in range, distinctness, the required sum/property, format) and exits with code 0 only if valid. Do not compare such outputs with the brute force directly.
